'''Seeker Soldiers''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in the [[Mistlands]] and in [[Infested Mine]]s.

Seekers soldiers are large, highly durable insect-like creatures with traits similar to beetles, ants, and bees. While ordinary [[Seeker|Seekers]] resemble ants, Soldiers bear a resemblance to stag beetles, with powerful mandibles and a rounded, armored carapace. Unlike ordinary Seekers, Soldiers do not have wings.

